%% The compare board: the URL is the state, useSyncExternalStore is the bridge.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Empty: open /compare
    Empty --> OneSelected: click an entry chip
    OneSelected --> TwoSelected: add a second
    TwoSelected --> ThreeSelected: add a third
    ThreeSelected --> FourSelected: add a fourth
    FourSelected --> ThreeSelected: remove one (limit is 4)

    OneSelected --> Empty: remove the last chip
    TwoSelected --> OneSelected: remove a chip
    ThreeSelected --> TwoSelected: remove a chip

    state "URL: ?with=slug-a,slug-b" as URLNote
    TwoSelected --> URLNote: history.replaceState + custom event
    URLNote --> TwoSelected: useSyncExternalStore re-reads

    Empty --> TwoSelected: paste a shared ?with= link
    note right of Empty
        The static export cannot read a
        query string at build time, so the
        server page renders a shell and the
        island owns everything interactive.
    end note
